# Reference KPIs (golden master).
#
# The four pure-end enthalpies are the DATUM pins: on a sensible datum they
# would each sit about 2.4e5 J/mol away, so the datum cannot change quietly.
# lambda_min/max bracket  H_vapour(y*) - h_liquid(x)  along the locus -- the
# quantity CONSTANT MOLAR OVERFLOW assumes does not move.  Their ratio here
# is 1.107, and that spread is the whole reason this case exists.
#
# kind   name      key         expected        reltol
diag    hxy                    H_vapour_pure1_J_per_mol     -231233.2          1e-4
diag    hxy                    H_vapour_pure2_J_per_mol     -239304.0          1e-4
diag    hxy                    P_Pa                         101325.0           1e-4
diag    hxy                    T_bubble_pure1_K             351.5              1e-4
diag    hxy                    T_bubble_pure2_K             372.5              1e-4
diag    hxy                    h_liquid_pure1_J_per_mol     -271912.8          1e-4
diag    hxy                    h_liquid_pure2_J_per_mol     -280791.7          1e-4
diag    hxy                    lambda_max_J_per_mol         45052.6            1e-4
diag    hxy                    lambda_min_J_per_mol         40679.6            1e-4
diag    hxy                    n_nodes                      82.0               1e-4
diag    hxy                    n_refused                    0.0                1e-4
